'''Ushiwakamaru''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that can be obtained at an extremely low chance when playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]] event. He was added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]].

