==Trivia==
*Ushikawakamaru is based on the Japanese legend [[wikipedia:Minamoto no Yoshitsune|Minamoto no Yoshitsune]], also known as Ushiwakamaru, while Colossal Benkei is based on Yoshitsune's rival, then retainer, [[wikipedia:Benkei|Benkei]], re-imagined as a giant robot.
**The H.E.I.K.E. corps are named after the [[wikipedia:Taira clan|Taira clan]], also known as Heike, which the real Ushiwakamaru destroyed in 1185 after numerous battles.
*Ushiwakamaru is the only Ultra Soul to be based on a real person as opposed to a fairy tale or folktale.
*Colossal Benkei is a reference to the manga, ''tokusatsu'' and OVA series ''[[wikipedia:Giant Robo|Giant Robo]]''. Not only does its overall body shape strongly resemble that of Giant Robo itself in the ''Giant Robo: The Day the Earth Stood Still'', but its Japanese description calls it a Robo, not a robot.

